01:30.657 --> 01:34.747
Something to Fill the Hole

01:33.887 --> 01:36.477
Everyone! Let's join together
and fight as one!

01:36.597 --> 01:38.437
- Right!
- Right!

01:38.597 --> 01:39.557
Hinata!

01:39.847 --> 01:41.017
Time for you to recover!

01:46.187 --> 01:47.227
<i>You guys...</i>

01:48.977 --> 01:50.307
Such a futile demonstration.

02:08.097 --> 02:09.517
It's transforming again!

02:09.557 --> 02:12.597
No, it's only reverting
to its original form.

02:13.227 --> 02:15.517
That was only its attack form.

02:17.267 --> 02:18.267
However...

02:19.727 --> 02:22.057
It's just one stage away
from its final transformation.

02:25.267 --> 02:26.767
Naruto's still recovering,

02:26.847 --> 02:28.687
and Nine Tails is
infusing chakra right now.

02:28.727 --> 02:30.937
Right now, it's up to us, Bee!

02:31.727 --> 02:35.017
Right. We'll show everyone the way!

02:35.227 --> 02:36.597
Listen to me, Bee...

02:37.937 --> 02:40.847
If we let it undergo
its final transformation, we've lost.

02:42.017 --> 02:42.937
We must stop it now!

02:55.187 --> 02:57.557
<i>Ten Tails isn't holding back...</i>

02:58.227 --> 02:59.937
<i>It probably got impatient</i>

03:00.017 --> 03:02.807
<i>after seeing the same Tailed Beasts</i>
<i>inside Naruto!</i>

03:04.437 --> 03:09.597
The fun's just beginning,
but it looks like I need to move soon.

03:14.557 --> 03:17.057
It's getting bigger and bigger.

03:17.557 --> 03:20.137
I- Is it after Naruto?

03:23.387 --> 03:25.597
<i>Honestly, how're we going</i>
<i>to stop that thing</i>

03:25.687 --> 03:27.227
<i>without Naruto's chakra?</i>

03:35.137 --> 03:39.017
We can't waver after
coming this far!

03:39.977 --> 03:43.557
Naruto is putting everything
into doing what has to be done.

03:44.727 --> 03:48.847
<i>It's even more painful for me...</i>
<i>not to have any comrades in here!</i>

03:49.767 --> 03:52.847
Naruto's words just now
made it clear!

03:53.687 --> 03:56.637
Yeah. He's been going
out of his way

03:56.727 --> 03:57.937
even to protect shinobi like us...

03:58.017 --> 03:59.137
That's not what
I was talking about!

04:00.687 --> 04:01.727
He's told us that

04:01.807 --> 04:04.847
he considers all of us his comrades
from the bottom of his heart.

04:06.307 --> 04:07.097
Comrades...

04:07.597 --> 04:08.687
Comrades...

04:09.597 --> 04:11.727
- We're...
- That's right, I'm his...

04:11.937 --> 04:13.887
- Me, too...
- That's right, we all are...

04:16.437 --> 04:17.727
We all are...

04:18.637 --> 04:19.557
Yeah.

04:20.727 --> 04:21.807
We're comrades!

04:22.307 --> 04:23.387
Comrades!

04:24.517 --> 04:25.477
Comrades!

04:25.937 --> 04:27.937
I'll fully heal Naruto!

04:29.097 --> 04:32.517
We have to do
what we have to do!

04:33.977 --> 04:35.637
If we're going to die anyway,

04:36.187 --> 04:37.807
we might as well go down...

04:39.557 --> 04:42.097
fighting to the best of our abilities!

04:47.307 --> 04:48.097
Ino!

04:49.437 --> 04:51.057
I want you to link me
with someone!

04:51.727 --> 04:52.767
You've got a plan, haven't you?

04:53.437 --> 04:54.767
I knew you would
come through, Shikamaru!

04:55.307 --> 04:57.557
Isn't there anything
we can do, Dad?

04:58.227 --> 04:59.477
I don't have enough chakra.

04:59.557 --> 05:01.687
<i>Kitsuchi! Please hear me out!</i>

05:02.687 --> 05:04.767
<i>You're Shikaku's child...</i>

05:05.637 --> 05:07.887
<i>Teach me the signs to</i>
<i>an easy Earth Style Barrier</i>

05:07.977 --> 05:11.017
<i>that even non-Stone Ninja</i>
<i>can perform!</i>

05:11.597 --> 05:15.727
<i>One that anyone could perform</i>
<i>would be too weak!</i>

05:16.017 --> 05:17.057
<i>It would be better to...</i>

05:17.187 --> 05:20.387
<i>No, it's crucial that</i>
<i>everyone be able to produce it.</i>

05:20.637 --> 05:22.887
<i>If the enemy has quality,</i>
<i>we've got quantity.</i>

05:23.307 --> 05:25.437
<i>But these walls will</i>
<i>be blown away quickly.</i>

05:25.727 --> 05:26.767
<i>Even if they are</i>

05:26.847 --> 05:29.887
<i>if we keep creating more,</i>
<i>they'll act like a shield.</i>

05:30.347 --> 05:32.477
<i>We're going to slow</i>
<i>that thing's momentum</i>

05:32.557 --> 05:35.097
<i>with many weak walls rather than</i>
<i>try to stop it with one powerful one!</i>

05:36.307 --> 05:39.057
<i>Of course, I intend to have</i>
<i>all of you from the Hidden Stone</i>

05:39.137 --> 05:41.767
<i>build me a super wall as well...</i>

05:42.637 --> 05:46.437
<i>I see... Your idea might be</i>
<i>worth a try.</i>

05:46.977 --> 05:49.387
<i>All right,</i>
<i>these are the hand signs!</i>

05:49.767 --> 05:50.887
<i>Before we start...</i>

05:51.977 --> 05:53.057
<i>Master Bee!</i>

05:54.267 --> 05:56.597
<i>While everyone is</i>
<i>building barriers,</i>

05:56.597 --> 05:59.137
<i>I want you to bombard that thing</i>
<i>with Tailed Beast Bombs</i>

05:59.227 --> 06:01.227
<i>to shift its trajectory upwards.</i>

06:03.057 --> 06:03.847
<i>Ino...</i>

06:05.637 --> 06:07.637
Next, I want you to link me

06:07.727 --> 06:09.687
with every shinobi here
on the battlefield.

06:10.187 --> 06:10.937
Can you do it?

06:11.267 --> 06:13.687
Doesn't matter, I will do it!

06:21.637 --> 06:24.557
What's your issue with
a Genjutsu World?

06:25.637 --> 06:26.887
Reality is cruel.

06:27.597 --> 06:29.847
This hole is only going to get bigger.

06:31.637 --> 06:34.347
Things don't always
go the way you want them.

06:34.767 --> 06:36.687
Nor does help always
get there in time.

06:39.557 --> 06:41.267
Just like how it was with me!

06:43.137 --> 06:45.477
Just like how I couldn't
get there in time!

06:47.597 --> 06:49.477
Wouldn't you agree, Kakashi?

06:50.477 --> 06:53.687
How are you going to seal
this hole by staying in this world?!

06:58.387 --> 07:02.847
I may be trash as a shinobi,
but I've learned a few things.

07:12.767 --> 07:16.937
The hole in one's heart gets filled
by others around you.

07:18.727 --> 07:21.387
Friends won't flock to
someone who abandons

07:21.477 --> 07:25.687
the memory of his friends
and gives up on the world...

07:25.767 --> 07:27.767
Just because things don't go
the way he wants them to.

07:29.347 --> 07:32.517
That won't help fill
the hole in your heart.

07:33.387 --> 07:37.637
And people don't help those
who run away and do nothing.

07:39.727 --> 07:43.437
As long as you don't give up,
there will always be salvation.

07:59.637 --> 08:01.387
No matter what you do...

08:06.267 --> 08:07.227
It's over.

08:08.767 --> 08:10.937
- Earth Style Barrier!
- Earth Style Barrier!

08:11.937 --> 08:13.017
Here it comes, Bee!

08:13.097 --> 08:14.307
Let's go!

08:16.937 --> 08:18.597
Its power is off the charts!

08:27.727 --> 08:30.097
<i>It's more powerful than I thought.</i>

08:30.187 --> 08:31.187
<i>At this rate...</i>

08:36.227 --> 08:37.597
<i>The last barrier...!</i>

08:43.557 --> 08:44.597
Lord Bee!

08:47.727 --> 08:49.807
All your tedious whitewashing!

08:50.187 --> 08:53.727
One can only achieve true happiness
by abandoning reality

08:53.807 --> 08:56.937
and ridding yourself of
the memories of your comrades!

08:57.887 --> 09:03.227
In the ninja world, those who
break the rules are scum.

09:03.767 --> 09:09.387
But... those who abandon
their friends are worse than scum.

09:10.637 --> 09:15.887
And... those who don't care
about their friends' feelings...

09:17.347 --> 09:19.387
are even worse scum!

09:27.937 --> 09:29.187
It vanished...?

09:34.347 --> 09:37.017
I won't abandon my memory
of the old you.

09:38.687 --> 09:42.517
Even if it's the current you
who's repudiating it.

09:48.637 --> 09:49.767
Am I late?

09:50.557 --> 09:51.347
Nope.

09:51.807 --> 09:53.687
Right on time, Dad!

09:54.627 --> 09:55.687
<b>FOURTH HOKAGE</b>

09:55.767 --> 09:56.727
Who...?

09:57.637 --> 09:58.557
Who's...?

10:07.307 --> 10:08.887
My name's Minato Namikaze.

10:09.687 --> 10:10.937
Brace for an impending explosion.

10:15.937 --> 10:16.687
What is that?

10:17.687 --> 10:18.637
What?

10:20.227 --> 10:23.387
I sent Ten Tails' attack
back toward the sea.

10:26.437 --> 10:27.887
- What's that?!
- Is it an attack?!

10:27.977 --> 10:28.807
Watch out!

10:30.187 --> 10:31.637
What the hell's going on?!

10:33.307 --> 10:34.267
What just happened?!

10:37.727 --> 10:40.387
That shock wave came
out of nowhere!

10:40.637 --> 10:41.597
What's with that?!

10:41.597 --> 10:42.887
Stop complaining!

10:43.437 --> 10:46.017
We're lucky that
we got off that easily!

10:51.767 --> 10:53.597
<i>He has Reanimation eyes!</i>

10:54.807 --> 10:56.687
Wh-Who are you?

10:57.187 --> 10:59.687
Relax. I'm an ally.

11:00.637 --> 11:02.767
Thanks for healing Naruto!

11:03.687 --> 11:04.847
Are you...

11:05.767 --> 11:07.137
Naruto's girlfriend?

11:07.637 --> 11:08.437
Huh?

11:08.727 --> 11:10.227
Hmm...

11:10.637 --> 11:11.937
Uh-huh... Yeah!

11:12.687 --> 11:13.557
I suppose you could say that.

11:13.937 --> 11:15.517
You keep quiet!

11:17.557 --> 11:19.347
Don't waste your energy talking!

11:21.057 --> 11:23.937
You're supposed to be healing me,
but I just suffered more damage...

11:24.017 --> 11:26.347
I'll heal the extra damage too!

11:29.557 --> 11:31.637
<i>She reminds me a little of Kushina...</i>

11:33.057 --> 11:35.597
Please go easy on my son.

11:38.307 --> 11:40.767
So, why did this happen so suddenly?

11:40.887 --> 11:42.687
It seems like you knew.

11:43.937 --> 11:46.137
I sensed his chakra when
I was in Nine Tails Mode.

11:47.017 --> 11:48.767
The others should be arriving soon...

11:50.727 --> 11:51.767
Something's coming!

11:58.557 --> 12:02.347
Minato, you're as fast as ever!

12:03.557 --> 12:04.887
Lord Third Hokage?!

12:05.557 --> 12:06.387
And also...

12:06.517 --> 12:07.517
That's the...!

12:08.517 --> 12:09.477
Fourth...

12:10.307 --> 12:12.767
You're better
at teleporting than I am!

12:13.977 --> 12:16.597
All right, let's do this!

12:17.807 --> 12:18.597
No way!

12:19.597 --> 12:20.637
I don't believe it...

12:22.687 --> 12:23.557
Lords First...

12:23.937 --> 12:25.097
Second...

12:25.517 --> 12:26.727
Third...

12:27.597 --> 12:28.767
and even Lord Fourth...

12:29.227 --> 12:30.597
Minato!

12:31.767 --> 12:36.057
So you're the ones
who stopped the attack, Lords Hokage!

12:36.687 --> 12:38.597
But who reanimated you?

12:39.557 --> 12:41.807
Orochimaru summoned us.

12:42.557 --> 12:45.137
We need to stop this war quickly.

12:45.767 --> 12:48.687
What? Didn't Orochimaru die?

12:49.477 --> 12:50.347
This is amazing!

12:50.437 --> 12:52.517
The previous Hokage are going
to join us in battle!

12:52.767 --> 12:53.937
Now that's reassuring!

12:54.767 --> 12:56.637
I don't know
what's going on anymore...

12:56.807 --> 12:59.097
There's still more help coming,

13:00.557 --> 13:02.767
but they're taking a little longer.

13:09.137 --> 13:12.977
I've been waiting for you, Hashirama!

13:14.387 --> 13:15.557
I'll deal with you later!

13:18.057 --> 13:19.597
I have to stop
the Ten Tails first!

13:22.347 --> 13:24.187
He hasn't changed a bit.

13:25.267 --> 13:27.227
We're never on the same page.

13:27.727 --> 13:28.887
After all...

13:30.807 --> 13:32.557
It's charging towards us...

13:36.137 --> 13:38.597
You've done well, Naruto.

13:39.097 --> 13:40.557
Take a little break.

13:42.057 --> 13:44.637
Your friend will be here soon.

13:45.767 --> 13:46.807
He's our ally too.

13:50.517 --> 13:51.687
<i>He is?</i>

13:56.727 --> 13:57.597
<i>This presence...</i>

13:58.847 --> 14:01.597
<i>It's Minato... What's going on?</i>

14:02.557 --> 14:04.767
My fellow Hokage, let's go!

14:10.347 --> 14:13.727
Second and Third,
stand in front of me.

14:15.137 --> 14:18.097
<i>That's exactly like Naruto's...</i>

14:19.477 --> 14:22.597
I never imagined
Minato would too!

14:23.347 --> 14:24.597
See! You see!

14:24.597 --> 14:26.937
Isn't my dad awesome?!

14:27.187 --> 14:29.767
I know that better than you!

14:34.637 --> 14:35.727
Reaper Death Seal!

14:46.807 --> 14:48.137
<i>Let's put our trust in this child!</i>

14:48.727 --> 14:51.097
<i>He's our son, after all!</i>

14:52.137 --> 14:53.017
Seal!

15:02.517 --> 15:06.557
After all, he's the one who
split me up before sealing me away!

15:07.307 --> 15:08.977
<b>THIRD HOKAGE</b>

15:09.477 --> 15:11.687
Have you already placed
your markers?

15:11.937 --> 15:12.637
Yes.

15:12.727 --> 15:15.227
You're quick at striking too!

15:23.347 --> 15:24.187
He vanished!

15:27.557 --> 15:28.557
Let's go!

15:28.937 --> 15:29.937
Ninja Art...

15:30.977 --> 15:32.597
- Four Crimson Ray Formation!
- Four Crimson Ray Formation!

15:44.517 --> 15:47.057
And... I'll just add on...

15:47.847 --> 15:50.807
Sage Art: Gracious Deity Gates!

15:58.637 --> 16:00.187
Ten Seals!

16:05.687 --> 16:06.807
A red barrier?!

16:07.687 --> 16:10.517
It's said to be dozens of times
more powerful

16:10.597 --> 16:12.687
than the Four Purple
Flames Formation!

16:12.767 --> 16:14.267
It's a barrier that requires

16:14.347 --> 16:17.057
four Hokage-class shinobi
together to create!

16:20.517 --> 16:22.727
It won't be able to move
so easily now.

16:38.597 --> 16:40.937
You sure took your time
getting here, Sasuke.

16:44.597 --> 16:46.307
Sasu... ke?

16:48.517 --> 16:49.597
Is that you, Sakura?

16:50.597 --> 16:52.557
S-Sasuke! Why?!

16:58.687 --> 17:00.137
S-Sasuke!

17:00.267 --> 17:01.637
Hey, Ino! Stop!

17:01.977 --> 17:03.227
He's an enemy!

17:03.637 --> 17:06.847
Ino... You better keep your distance!

17:10.767 --> 17:13.437
You're all still as noisy as ever!

17:15.687 --> 17:17.187
Why the hell are you here, bastard?!

17:18.387 --> 17:21.807
Why are you here, Sasuke?

17:23.187 --> 17:24.687
A lot of things have happened.

17:25.307 --> 17:27.597
I've decided to protect Leaf Village.

17:29.307 --> 17:32.137
And then, I'll...

17:34.937 --> 17:36.767
become Hokage.

17:44.687 --> 17:45.687
What?!

17:46.347 --> 17:48.307
You can't just come back
all of a sudden

17:48.387 --> 17:50.307
and crack a lame joke like that,
you Rogue Ninja!

17:50.597 --> 17:52.847
Do you even know
what it means to be Hokage?

17:52.977 --> 17:57.477
I don't know what happened to you,
but that's not possible.

17:57.727 --> 18:00.267
Do you even realize
what you're saying?

18:00.347 --> 18:04.137
