and change the village.

18:25.267 --> 18:26.437
<i>You don't become Hokage</i>

18:26.517 --> 18:28.517
<i>in order to be acknowledged</i>
<i>by the village.</i>

18:29.227 --> 18:31.137
<i>The one who is acknowledged</i>
<i>by everyone,</i>

18:31.227 --> 18:32.387
<i>is the one who becomes Hokage.</i>

18:35.097 --> 18:37.017
<i>I leave Sasuke to you.</i>

18:42.637 --> 18:43.637
<i>Leave it to me.</i>

18:50.097 --> 18:53.347
I'm going to be Hokage!

